{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.1","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Dies iræ, dies illa",{"br":1},"Solvet sæclum in favílla:",{"br":1},"Teste David cum Sibýlla."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.2","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quantus tremor est futúrus,",{"br":1},"Quando judex est ventúrus,",{"br":1},"Cuncta stricte discussúrus!"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.3","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Tuba mirum spargens sonum",{"br":1},"Per sepúlcra regiónum,",{"br":1},"Coget omnes ante thronum."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.4","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Mors stupébit et natúra,",{"br":1},"Cum resúrget creatúra,",{"br":1},"Judicánti responsúra."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.5","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Liber scriptus proferétur,",{"br":1},"In quo totum continétur,",{"br":1},"Unde mundus judicétur."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.6","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Judex ergo cum sedébit,",{"br":1},"Quidquid latet, apparébit:",{"br":1},"Nil inúltum remanébit."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.7","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quid sum miser tunc dictúrus?",{"br":1},"Quem patrónum rogatúrus,",{"br":1},"Cum vix justus sit secúrus?"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.8","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Rex treméndæ majestátis,",{"br":1},"Qui salvándos salvas gratis,",{"br":1},"Salva me, fons pietátis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.9","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Recordáre, Jesu pie,",{"br":1},"Quod sum causa tuæ viæ:",{"br":1},"Ne me perdas illa die."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.10","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Quærens me, sedísti lassus:",{"br":1},"Redemísti Crucem passus:",{"br":1},"Tantus labor non sit cassus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.11","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Juste judex ultiónis,",{"br":1},"Donum fac remissiónis",{"br":1},"Ante diem ratiónis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.12","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Ingemísco, tamquam reus:",{"br":1},"Culpa rubet vultus meus:",{"br":1},"Supplicánti parce, Deus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.13","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Qui Maríam absolvísti,",{"br":1},"Et latrónem exaudísti,",{"br":1},"Mihi quoque spem dedísti."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.14","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Preces meæ non sunt dignæ:",{"br":1},"Sed tu bonus fac benígne,",{"br":1},"Ne perénni cremer igne."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.15","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Inter oves locum præsta,",{"br":1},"Et ab hœdis me sequéstra,",{"br":1},"Státuens in parte dextra."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.16","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Confutátis maledíctis,",{"br":1},"Flammis ácribus addíctis:",{"br":1},"Voca me cum benedíctis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.17","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Oro supplex et acclínis,",{"br":1},"Cor contrítum quasi cinis:",{"br":1},"Gere curam mei finis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.18","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Lacrimósa dies illa,",{"br":1},"Qua resúrget ex favílla",{"br":1},"Judicándus homo reus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.sequence.19","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Huic ergo parce, Deus:",{"br":1},"Pie Jesu Dómine,",{"br":1},"Dona eis réquiem.",{"br":1},"Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.evangile","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/11-02m1.txt","section":"Evangelium"}],"t":{"la":["Evangelium"],"fr":["Évangile"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.evangile.1","type":"para","style":"intro","t":{"la":["Sequéntia ",{"sym":"cross"}," sancti Evangélii secúndum Joánnem"],"fr":["Suite ",{"sym":"cross"}," du saint Évangile selon saint Jean"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.evangile.2","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Joann 5:25-29"],"fr":["Joann 5:25-29"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.evangile.3","type":"para","t":{"la":["In illo témpore: Dixit Jesus turbis Judæórum: Amen, amen, dico vobis, quia venit hora, et nunc est, quando mórtui áudient vocem Fílii Dei: et qui audíerint, vivent. Sicut enim Pater habet vitam in semetípso, sic dedit et Fílio habére vitam in semetípso: et potestátem dedit ei judícium fácere, quia Fílius hóminis est. Nolíte mirári hoc, quia venit hora, in qua omnes, qui in monuméntis sunt, áudient vocem Fílii Dei: et procédent, qui bona fecérunt, in resurrectiónem vitæ: qui vero mala egérunt, in resurrectiónem judícii."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.credo","type":"rubric","credo":false,"t":{"fr":["On ne dit pas le Credo."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.offertoire","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"horas/Latin/Commune/C9.txt","section":"Offertorium"}],"t":{"la":["Offertorium"],"fr":["Offertoire"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.offertoire.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Dómine Jesu Christe, Rex glóriæ, líbera ánimas ómnium fidélium defunctórum de pœnis inférni et de profúndo lacu: líbera eas de ore leónis, ne absórbeat eas tártarus, ne cadant in obscúrum: sed sígnifer sanctus Míchaël repræséntet eas in lucem sanctam:"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.offertoire.2","type":"para","t":{"la":["* Quam olim Abrahæ promisísti et sémini ejus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.offertoire.3","type":"versicle","role":"V","t":{"la":[{"sym":"V"}," ","Hóstias et preces tibi, Dómine, laudis offérimus: tu súscipe pro animábus illis, quarum hódie memóriam fácimus: fac eas, Dómine, de morte transíre ad vitam."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.offertoire.4","type":"para","t":{"la":["* Quam olim Abrahæ promisísti et sémini ejus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.secrete","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/11-02m1.txt","section":"Secreta"}],"t":{"la":["Secreta"],"fr":["Secrète"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m1.secrete.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Hóstias, quǽsumus, Dómine, quas tibi pro animábus famulórum famularúmque tuárum offérimus, propitiátus inténde: ut, quibus fídei christiánæ méritum contulísti, dones et prǽmium. Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum, Fílium tuum: qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
