{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.sequence.15","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Inter oves locum præsta,",{"br":1},"Et ab hœdis me sequéstra,",{"br":1},"Státuens in parte dextra."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.sequence.16","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Confutátis maledíctis,",{"br":1},"Flammis ácribus addíctis:",{"br":1},"Voca me cum benedíctis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.sequence.17","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Oro supplex et acclínis,",{"br":1},"Cor contrítum quasi cinis:",{"br":1},"Gere curam mei finis."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.sequence.18","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Lacrimósa dies illa,",{"br":1},"Qua resúrget ex favílla",{"br":1},"Judicándus homo reus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.sequence.19","type":"stanza","kind":"hymn","t":{"la":["Huic ergo parce, Deus:",{"br":1},"Pie Jesu Dómine,",{"br":1},"Dona eis réquiem.",{"br":1},"Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.evangile","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/11-02m2.txt","section":"Evangelium"}],"t":{"la":["Evangelium"],"fr":["Évangile"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.evangile.1","type":"para","style":"intro","t":{"la":["Sequéntia ",{"sym":"cross"}," sancti Evangélii secúndum Joánnem"],"fr":["Suite ",{"sym":"cross"}," du saint Évangile selon saint Jean"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.evangile.2","type":"rubric","t":{"la":["Joann 6:37-40"],"fr":["Joann 6:37-40"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.evangile.3","type":"para","t":{"la":["In illo témpore: Dixit Jesus turbis Judæórum: Omne, quod dat mihi Pater, ad me véniet: et eum, qui venit ad me, non ejíciam foras: quia descéndi de cælo, non ut fáciam voluntátem meam, sed voluntátem ejus, qui misit me. Hæc est autem volúntas ejus, qui misit me, Patris: ut omne, quod dedit mihi, non perdam ex eo, sed resúscitem illud in novíssimo die. Hæc est autem volúntas Patris mei, qui misit me: ut omnis, qui videt Fílium et credit in eum, hábeat vitam ætérnam, et ego resuscitábo eum in novíssimo die."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.credo","type":"rubric","credo":false,"t":{"fr":["On ne dit pas le Credo."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.offertoire","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"horas/Latin/Commune/C9.txt","section":"Offertorium"}],"t":{"la":["Offertorium"],"fr":["Offertoire"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.offertoire.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Dómine Jesu Christe, Rex glóriæ, líbera ánimas ómnium fidélium defunctórum de pœnis inférni et de profúndo lacu: líbera eas de ore leónis, ne absórbeat eas tártarus, ne cadant in obscúrum: sed sígnifer sanctus Míchaël repræséntet eas in lucem sanctam:"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.offertoire.2","type":"para","t":{"la":["* Quam olim Abrahæ promisísti et sémini ejus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.offertoire.3","type":"versicle","role":"V","t":{"la":[{"sym":"V"}," ","Hóstias et preces tibi, Dómine, laudis offérimus: tu súscipe pro animábus illis, quarum hódie memóriam fácimus: fac eas, Dómine, de morte transíre ad vitam."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.offertoire.4","type":"para","t":{"la":["* Quam olim Abrahæ promisísti et sémini ejus."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.secrete","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/11-02m2.txt","section":"Secreta"}],"t":{"la":["Secreta"],"fr":["Secrète"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m2.secrete.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Propitiáre, Dómine, supplicatiónibus nostris, pro animábus famulórum famularúmque tuárum, pro quibus tibi offérimus sacrifícium laudis; ut eas Sanctórum tuórum consórtio sociáre dignéris. Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum, Fílium tuum: qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
