{"id":"sancti-11-02.m3.collecte","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/11-02m3.txt","section":"Oratio"}],"t":{"la":["Oratio"],"fr":["Collecte"]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m3.collecte.1","type":"para","t":{"la":["Deus, véniæ largítor et humánæ salútis amátor: quǽsumus cleméntiam tuam; ut nostræ congregatiónis fratres, propínquos et benefactóres, qui ex hoc sǽculo transiérunt, beáta María semper Vírgine intercedénte cum ómnibus Sanctis tuis, ad perpétuæ beatitúdinis consórtium perveníre concédas. Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Christum, Fílium tuum: qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus, per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum. ",{"sym":"R"}," Amen."]}}
{"id":"sancti-11-02.m3.lecon","type":"heading","level":2,"x-source":[{"file":"missa/Latin/Sancti/11-02m3.txt","section":"Lectio"}],"t":{"la":["Lectio"],"fr":["Leçon"]}}
